reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"94"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"H"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hinako is the landlord of \"Tsubakisou\" apartment complex where the protagonist lives. Hinako is soft spoken, carries herself in a very receptive manner, and exudes a motherly aura. In contrast to her calming demeanor, she is a bit of a scatterbrain and has a habit of carelessly rushing into things without fully thinking them through."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Coupled with her love for Tsubakisou, Hinako's hobby is DIY construction. She takes pride in having renovated the battered down apartment complex with her own hands and never misses a day of maintenance and grounds-keeping."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hinako's love for Tsubakisou is so great that she even goes as far as to say that her first love was not for a human being, but rather for Tsubakisou."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88390"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が暮らすアパート『つばき荘』の管理人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目も口調も雰囲気もすべてが柔らかく、包容力や母性といった言葉がよく似合う女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で少し抜けたところもあり、早合点して行動してしまう天然さもあり油断ならない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"つばき荘を心から愛しており、ボロボロだった建物を自らの手でリフォームし、日々、掃除等のメンテナンスを欠かすことがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな愛情は恋愛観にも及んでいて、彼女の初恋の相手は人間ではなく、つばき荘であるほど。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22192","sourceWorkId":"29093","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が暮らすアパート『つばき荘』の管理人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目も口調も雰囲気もすべてが柔らかく、包容力や母性といった言葉がよく似合う女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で少し抜けたところもあり、早合点して行動してしまう天然さもあり油断ならない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text"